{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:51 2026-08-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:51 2026-08-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:51 2026-08-15 HKT</p><p>今(15日)中午12時20分，旺角奶路臣街15B號地下一間鐘錶店，職員發現玻璃門遭淋白油刑毀，報警求助。警員到場調查，一個油漆容器棄在店舖的第一道門與第二道門之間，玻璃門及地上遺下白油迹。探員正調查兇徒動機。</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/17267e85244297a24047c1e2ae7fe46c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_46.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"探員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b4b4e9c428fa4aa501c2cfb1a1a8fef1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_44.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/63ec8f5a7e4161e53d36b2c1400c9f81/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_43.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"門口地面遺下白油迹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e328563c008d258e07febf2946e1d2cf/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_38.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"地上遺下白油迹。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/264f09c72f9fb1fa979f50edfb4f1a40/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_36.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/746e3b48cf6b3f6e232537f48a75ba87/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"玻璃門被淋白油，地上遺下白油容器。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/06e67574b354de1dd7a055056a6ad6d0/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_29.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4f5bc30a5462b58e1d88e49367414922/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_14_30_28.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T06:58:27.484017+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}